DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43836::$$$message_0373_0000_0000$$$::"Got 'em all in one! Caster and Assassin are defeated!"[nolr][p]::
43837::$$$message_0373_0000_0001$$$::"We lost... All three of us..."::
43838::$$$message_0373_0001_0000$$$::"I'm so sorry, Master... Forgive me for this failure, even if it was mostly Assassin's fault..."::
43839::$$$message_0373_0001_0001$$$::"My fault?"::
43840::$$$message_0373_0001_0002$$$::"No, I deserve the blame... I've done nothing but train a useless technique. I never knew such a game existed."::
43841::$$$message_0373_0001_0003$$$::"Huh? Souichirou, was this your first time playing hanafuda?"::
43842::$$$message_0373_0001_0004$$$::"Yes. I'm sorry, Caster. I'm responsible for this failure."::
43843::$$$message_0373_0001_0005$$$::"N-no, I'm not very familiar with the game either, so it's only natural that we lost."::
43844::$$$message_0373_0001_0006$$$::"...Still, there's still no excuse for the freeloader, who claimed to be a veteran player."::
43845::$$$message_0373_0001_0007$$$::"That's harsh. It's said that hanafuda depends on one's innate luck. You and I are unluckier than the average person."::
43846::$$$message_0373_0001_0008$$$::"Time will overcome that absurdity."::
43847::$$$message_0373_0002_0000$$$::"I've also changed my mind. I will endeavor to master such games."::
43848::$$$message_0373_0002_0001$$$::"Medea. For now, let us go buy a game to play ourselves."::
43849::$$$message_0373_0002_0002$$$::"Y-yes! [wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=照 time=200]I would be happy to, Master...!"::
43850::$$$message_0373_0002_0003$$$::"I think that concludes this, Ms. Fujimura.[lr]::
43851::$$$message_0373_0002_0004$$$::This was a good lesson. Allow me to repay you for it one day."::
43852::$$$message_0373_0002_0005$$$::"Huh? Um, what?"::
43853::$$$message_0373_0002_0006$$$::"Allow me to thank you as well.[lr]::
43854::$$$message_0373_0002_0007$$$::I'm sorry for insulting you two earlier."[wm canskip=0][nolr][p]::
43855::$$$message_0373_0002_0008$$$::"Um. Y'know, this is leaving a bitter taste in my mouth..."::
43856::$$$message_0373_0002_0009$$$::"Hahaha. You never know how things will turn out!"::
43857::$$$message_0373_0002_0010$$$::"That vixen has found the silver lining in losing this match. How oddly the stars fall sometimes."::
43858::$$$message_0373_0002_0011$$$::"Don't 'hahaha' me.[lr]::
43859::$$$message_0373_0002_0012$$$::So you're saying you played us?"::
43860::$$$message_0373_0002_0013$$$::"Forgive me. I rarely have any opportunity for recreation. A bird flew within reach, so I got ahead of myself."::
43861::$$$message_0373_0002_0014$$$::"I must say, I rather enjoyed that, tiger girl and prepubescent buruma."::
43862::$$$message_0373_0002_0015$$$::"You don't have to force yourself to use Japanese there."::
43863::$$$message_0373_0002_0016$$$::"And now I shall take my leave, as well. You still have Berserker and Lancer left, yes?"::
43864::$$$message_0373_0002_0017$$$::"From what I've heard, Berserker is in the forest on the outskirts of town. You may as well take the opportunity to knock him down a peg."[nolr][p]::
43865::$$$message_0373_0002_0018$$$::"...Mrgh. I don't like how it happened, but we got another star."::
43866::$$$message_0373_0002_0019$$$::"The forest is close by, so let's go beat Berserker, Illya."::
43867::$$$message_0373_0002_0020$$$::"Huh...? Oh, but Berserker seems strong, so shouldn't we save him for last?"::
43868::$$$message_0373_0003_0000$$$::"Speaking of which, I was thinking we could just let him fight Lancer."::
43869::$$$message_0373_0003_0001$$$::"Why? Let's go get Berserker if he's close by. Or did you not want to fight him?"::
43870::$$$message_0373_0003_0002$$$::"Not exactly... Fine, we can go if you insist.[lr]::
43871::$$$message_0373_0003_0003$$$::...[hfsigh layer=1](sigh)"::
43872::$$$message_0373_0003_0004$$$::"Sounds like a plan! Let's go grab those last two stars!"::
43873::$$$message_0373_0003_0005$$$::"Berserker, huh... I guess there's no running away from it."[nolr][p]:��
